  AbilityName: Bull Rush
  AbilityDescription: 'Charge up to 3 tiles. Whoever you hit takes 1 damage and flies back 5 tiles.'
  Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a419714c55594e2596e60ba8716985f, type: 3}
  Title: The Prodigy
  Strength: Food
  Weakness: Women
  Bio: 'Nik once served a distant kingdom, where he was counted among its brightest minds and finest warriors. Yet he abandoned his promising future in search of something greater, carrying only his sword, his wisdom, and a suspicious number of cooking pots. He once rejected a noblewoman whose breasts, according to local legend, could have breastfed an entire village. Despite his brilliance, Nik has always preferred the shadows to the spotlight. But now, for the first time, he is ready to step forward and claim command.'
  SignatureText: 'Charge up to 3 tiles. Whoever you hit takes 1 damage and flies back 5 tiles.'
